@knight42  we need to delete the test namespace and then driver namespace in order because:

1. If driver namespace is deleted before deleting the test namespace then pods in test namespace will be stuck in "terminating" state because CSI driver that is responsible for unmounting volumes will not be available.
2. We need to delete the test namespace (rather than say delete the pods which we do anyways), because deleting the test namespace first causes the test to start aborting. It works like a signal because it will cause executing test to exit and start running clean up routines.
